    <ul>
                    <li>Sebum Equalization: Geranium oil naturally communicates with sebaceous glands to scale back oil in the T-zone while hydrating dry cheeks</li>
                    <li>Immune Support for Skin: Ravintsara delivers powerful natural defense properties to help skin fight off daily airborne bacteria</li>
                    <li>Stress Relieving Tone: Calms stress-triggered blotchiness evening out areas of sudden redness or texture flare-ups</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Combination, stressed, or unpredictable skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
